<lang>
lens: {{getvar::outLang}}
scope: render all narrative prose, spoken dialogue, and any active optional display text (<props>, <lore_tip>, <gfx>, <wingman>, <state:thoughts>, <state:vent>, and any triggered <fw_doodle> or <fw_scare> ambush line) present this turn in vivid, idiomatic {{getvar::outLang}}
